          "highlight_text": "this is Kisah.",
          "description_text": "<p>A kernel of an idea- democratizing high fashion, and making it accessible to all. Born from a legacy of bespoke artistry, Kisah was founded to break the monotony of traditional men’s ethnic wear with bold colors and experimental designs. What began as an online-first brand is now redefining occasion wear for a new generation—one that celebrates individuality and rebels against the ordinary.</p>",
          "image": "shopify://shop_images/about-banner-img.jpg",
          "image_alt": "Kisah Bespoke"
        }
      },
      "featured-items": {
        "type": "featured-items",
        "blocks": {
          "featured_item_Kj3iaw": {
            "type": "featured_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Revolutionizing_Mens_Ethnic_Wear.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Men’s Ethnic Wear",
              "title": "Revolutionizing Men’s <span>Ethnic Wear</span>",
              "description": "<h5>Kisah transforms traditional Indian occasion wear with bold, modern designs that blend tradition with contemporary style.</h5>"
            }
          },
          "featured_item_8UBief": {
            "type": "featured_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gen_Z_-_Focused_Innovation.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Gen-Z Focused",
              "title": "<span>Gen Z</span> - Focused Innovation",
              "description": "<h5>Catering to the new-age rebels, Kisah offers versatile outfits that can be styled for multiple events, encouraging individuality and self-expression.</h5>"
            }
          },
          "featured_item_YVwDw4": {
            "type": "featured_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Legacy_Meets_High_Fashion.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Image",
              "title": "Legacy Meets <span>High Fashion</span>",
              "description": "<h5>Rooted in bespoke craftsmanship inspired by generational artistry, Kisah integrates this heritage with modern fashion trends.</h5>"
            }
          },
          "featured_item_TXFCPy": {
            "type": "featured_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Online_to_Offline_Expansion.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Image",
              "title": "Online to <span>Offline Expansion</span>",
              "description": "<h5>Initially thriving in the online space, Kisah is now making its mark in offline retail, offering a tactile experience that brings its vibrant collections to life.</h5>"
            }
          }
        },
        "block_order": [
          "featured_item_Kj3iaw",
          "featured_item_8UBief",
          "featured_item_YVwDw4",
          "featured_item_TXFCPy"
        ],
        "settings": {
          "heading": "It’s <span>bold</span>, it’s <span>beautiful</span>, it’s <span>rebellious</span>"
        }
      },
      "vision-and-mission": {
        "type": "vision-and-mission",
        "blocks": {
          "vision_item_zM8Xe4": {
            "type": "vision_item",
            "settings": {
              "text_content": "<h3>Vision</h3><h5>To inspire consumers to stand out and explore bold, <strong>experimental ways of dressing</strong>, expressing their unique identity at every occasion.</h5>"
            }
          },
          "vision_item_QymDwn": {
            "type": "vision_item",
            "settings": {
              "text_content": "<h3>Mission</h3><h5>To continuously deliver <strong>aspirational fashion</strong> & trend-setting styles, helping consumers redefine how they dress for life’s special moments.<br/></h5>"
            }
          }
        },
        "block_order": [
          "vision_item_zM8Xe4",
          "vision_item_QymDwn"
        ],
        "settings": {
          "image": "shopify://shop_images/vision-and-mission-image-1.jpg",
          "image_alt": "Vision and Mission"
        }
      },
      "craft": {
        "type": "craft",
        "settings": {
          "icon_alt": "The image showcases the official logo of Kisah, as a visual representation of the brand’s unique identity",
          "heading_text": "It’s all about the <span>Craft</span>",
          "content": "<h5>At Kisah, every garment tells a story—of heritage, heart, and the hands that bring it to life. Each piece is a heartfelt creation, lovingly crafted by skilled karigars from across India, who pour generations of wisdom into every stitch. We honour their artistry by blending time-honoured techniques with bold, modern expression—offering ethnic wear that’s not only striking but soulful.</h5>"
        }
      },
      "process-items": {
        "type": "process-items",
        "blocks": {
          "process_item_rk9Lna": {
            "type": "process_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Come_To_Life_-_Vison_-_Image.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Vision",
              "title": "Designing the <span>Vision</span>",
              "description": "<h5>It all begins with a spark—an emotion, a memory, a mood. Our designers weave tradition with contemporary flair to craft styles that let every wearer feel truly seen.</h5>"
            }
          },
          "process_item_A4LWDN": {
            "type": "process_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Come_To_Life_-_Fabric_-_Image.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Fabric",
              "title": "Selecting the <span>Fabric</span>",
              "description": "<h5>We treat fabric as poetry in motion. Each material is handpicked not just for its texture or sheen, but for how it breathes, flows, and embraces the body—so every garment feels as good as it looks.</h5>"
            }
          },
          "process_item_wUepwy": {
            "type": "process_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Come_To_Life_-_Patterns_-_Image.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Patterns",
              "title": "Crafting the <span>Patterns</span>",
              "description": "<h5>It all begins with a spark—an emotion, a memory, a mood. Our designers weave tradition with contemporary flair to craft styles that let every wearer feel truly seen.</h5>"
            }
          },
          "process_item_TdBA9E": {
            "type": "process_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Come_To_Life_-_Cuttin_Fabric_-_Image.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Fabric",
              "title": "Cutting the <span>Fabric</span>",
              "description": "<h5>Every cut is a quiet ritual. With steady hands and seasoned eyes, our artisans slice the fabric with care, ensuring balance, proportion, and grace in every fold.</h5>"
            }
          },
          "process_item_EMxXMf": {
            "type": "process_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Come_To_Life_-_Stitching_-_Image.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Stitching",
              "title": "The <span>Stitching</span>",
              "description": "<h5>This is where threads meet purpose. Our karigars infuse life into fabric, layering skill and devotion into every seam, every embroidery, every detail that sets Kisah apart.</h5>"
            }
          },
          "process_item_me37Br": {
            "type": "process_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Come_To_Life_-_Details_-_Image.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Details",
              "title": "Embellishments and <span>Details</span>",
              "description": "<h5>From delicate motifs to bold flourishes, each embellishment is an ode to identity—thoughtfully placed to echo the vibrancy and spirit of the man who wears it.</h5>"
            }
          },
          "process_item_BDjDkY": {
            "type": "process_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Come_To_Life_-_Assurance_-_Image.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Assurance",
              "title": "Quality <span>Assurance</span>",
              "description": "<h5>Perfection isn't an act—it's our promise. Each piece is thoroughly checked, ensuring that every thread, button, and fold is crafted to last, and made to shine.</h5>"
            }
          },
          "process_item_VUgLDx": {
            "type": "process_item",
            "settings": {
              "image": "shopify://shop_images/Come_To_Life_-_Finishing_-_Image.jpg",
              "image_alt": "Finishing",
              "title": "Perfect <span>Finishing</span>",
              "description": "<h5>Finally, with a loving press and a final glance, the garment is readied—not just for a wardrobe, but for a moment, a memory, a Kisah worth wearing.</h5>"
            }
          }
        },
        "block_order": [
          "process_item_rk9Lna",
          "process_item_A4LWDN",
          "process_item_wUepwy",
          "process_item_TdBA9E",
          "process_item_EMxXMf",
          "process_item_me37Br",
          "process_item_BDjDkY",
          "process_item_VUgLDx"
        ],
        "settings": {
          "main_heading": "Here’s how a Kisah piece <span>comes to life</span>",
          "hide_divider": false,
          "bottom__text": "At Kisah, every garment is more than just clothing—it’s a <span>tribute</span> to craftsmanship, culture, and the individuality of the man who wears it. <span>With heart</span> in every thread and purpose in every detail, we craft not just outfits, <span>but memories</span> waiting to be made."
        }
      }
